#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_bg_commodity_code/models/product_product.py:0
msgid ""
"The commodity code '%(code)s' of product '%(product)s' must contain only "
"digits and be exactly 8 (CN8) or 10 (TARIC10) digits long."
msgstr ""
"Кодът по КН „%(code)s“ на артикула „%(product)s“ трябва да съдържа само "
"цифри и да е точно 8 (КН8) или 10 (TARIC10) цифри."

#. module: l10n_bg_commodity_code
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_bg_commodity_code/models/product_product.py:0
